[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7501.03, "timestamp": "02:05:01", "text": "等等，这些是我唯一直播过的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7503.35, "timestamp": "02:05:03", "text": "中文版在哪里？ 哦，那是在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7508.629, "timestamp": "02:05:08", "text": "另一个战争频道里。 好吧，我的错。 嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7517.51, "timestamp": "02:05:17", "text": "办公，呃，和我一起工作，或者，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7520.229, "timestamp": "02:05:20", "text": "如果标题里有“"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7525.51, "timestamp": "02:05:25", "text": "联合办公”，我也想要那个。 所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7531.109, "timestamp": "02:05:31", "text": "我可以这样说。 如果这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7533.43, "timestamp": "02:05:33", "text": "TTV 标题等于这个，那么它就是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7537.109, "timestamp": "02:05:37", "text": "协作流。 如果真是这样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7539.189, "timestamp": "02:05:39", "text": "那将会是源源不断的供应。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7542.31, "timestamp": "02:05:42", "text": "那么，我们来测试一下。 我打算测试一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7546.07, "timestamp": "02:05:46", "text": "。 让我们祈祷并希望这能奏效。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7548.31, "timestamp": "02:05:48", "text": "我们目前的哦，等等，等等，等等。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7551.189, "timestamp": "02:05:51", "text": "还需要更改我在Twitch上的类别。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7553.35, "timestamp": "02:05:53", "text": "等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7554.95, "timestamp": "02:05:54", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7557.75, "timestamp": "02:05:57", "text": "那个直播标题。"}]